:: Bloomshore Kitchen
<<initPlayState>>\
<<if !Player.isYounger()>><<goto "Bloomshore District">><</if>>\
<<pronouns "caleb">>\
<<run World.setLocation("bloomshore-kitchen", "Bloomshore District — Home")>>\
<<run CalebBreakfast.ensure()>>\
<<set _meal to CalebBreakfast.meal($calebBreakfast.id)>>\
You stand in the kitchen.<<if CalebBreakfast.available()>> Morning light catches on clean counters; <<= _meal.name>> waits on a plate where <<Caleb>> left it for you.<<elseif $calebBreakfast.eaten && CalebBreakfast.isWindowOpen()>> Morning light catches on clean counters. The plate <<Caleb>> left for you is empty now.<<elseif !World.isBefore(6, 0) && !CalebBreakfast.isWindowOpen() && !$calebBreakfast.eaten>> The counters are clear — whatever <<Caleb>> cooked this morning is gone.<<elseif !World.isBefore(6, 0) && !CalebBreakfast.isWindowOpen() && $calebBreakfast.eaten>> Clean counters; the breakfast scent has mostly faded.<<else>> Clean counters wait in the quiet. <<Caleb>> usually leaves breakfast out between <<= World.formatTimeAt(6, 0)>> and <<= World.formatTimeAt(9, 0)>>.<</if>><<if $stats.hunger < 50 && CalebBreakfast.available()>> <<orange>>You can feel your stomach growling.<</orange>><</if>>

<<if CalebBreakfast.available()>>\
<<foodIcon "breakfast" `$calebBreakfast.id`>><<link `"Eat " + _meal.name + " <span class='action-time'>(0:" + String(_meal.minutes).padStart(2, "0") + ")</span>"`>><<goto "Bloomshore Kitchen Breakfast">><</link>> <<= Stats.effectMarkup("hunger", _meal.hunger) + Stats.effectMarkup("stress", _meal.stress) + LoveInterests.statEffectMarkup("caleb", "dominance", "+")>>
<<elseif $calebBreakfast.eaten && CalebBreakfast.isWindowOpen()>>\
<<blue>>You've already eaten the breakfast <<Caleb>> made today.<</blue>>
<<elseif !World.isBefore(6, 0) && !CalebBreakfast.isWindowOpen() && !$calebBreakfast.eaten>>\
<<blue>>You missed <<Caleb>>'s breakfast. <<He>> clears the kitchen after <<= World.formatTimeAt(9, 0)>>.<</blue>>
<</if>>\
<<gap>>
<<icon "apartment-hall">><<link "Return downstairs <span class='action-time'>(0:01)</span>">><<run World.advance(1)>><<goto "Bloomshore Downstairs">><</link>>

:: Bloomshore Kitchen Breakfast
<<initPlayState>>\
<<if !Player.isYounger()>><<goto "Bloomshore District">><</if>>\
<<pronouns "caleb">>\
<<run CalebBreakfast.ensure()>>\
<<set _meal to CalebBreakfast.meal($calebBreakfast.id)>>\
<<if CalebBreakfast.available() && _meal>>\
<<set _fx to CalebBreakfast.eat()>>\
<<= _meal.text>> <<= _fx>>
<<gap>>
<<link `"Finish eating your " + _meal.name`>><<goto "Bloomshore Kitchen">><</link>>
<<else>>\
<<goto "Bloomshore Kitchen">>
<</if>>
